      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/docs/ec-3po-design.md\n\nFor testing:\n\n`cros_workon --host start hdctools ec-devutils`\n`sudo emerge hdctools ec-devutils`\n\n# Start servod for a board and connect to it\n`sudo servod -b $BOARD`\n\n# Open up the EC console and verify that it works ok.\n`dut-control ec_uart_pty`\n\nFor testing enhanced console functionality, enable `CONFIG_EXPERIMENTAL_CONSOLE` in the board\u0027s board.h file. Build and flash the EC. Check the EC console that it\u0027s still working okay. Try sending commands, editing text, etc.",
